'''Marshadow''' (Japanese: '''マーシャドー''' ''Marshadow'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion.

